{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act28side_level_act28side_05_beg",
  "groupId": "act28side",
  "stageId": "act28side_05",
  "title": "疑惑之影",
  "storyCode": "CV-5",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act28side/level_act28side_05_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "e89141296210e3643e330f583b22be0f4afa051bf1766c5e8ab9a24fbaf9b328",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼情報小組成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……騷亂中兩人死亡，四人重傷，輕傷數十人，十三家店鋪與民宅遭受搶劫，主街道上還有部分區域有小範圍火災……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼情報小組成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "萬幸，各小隊已經迅速控制了局面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼情報小組成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "目前，在地塊的重要設施及幹道處，我們已經派駐了維持治安與秩序的傭兵小隊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼情報小組成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "請問我需要暫停匯報嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“橋夾”克里夫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "先暫停吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼情報小組成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那請允許我先離開，等您通話結束，我再進來匯報。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“橋夾”克里夫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒必要，一起聽吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銀行行長",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "克里夫先生，抱歉在這個時候來電打擾。那筆準備金我們已經入庫，感謝諸位一路押送。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“橋夾”克里夫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您不必為此致謝，這些事都寫在你我的合約之中。而且，比起電話，我更希望與您當面商議後續的拖拽事宜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銀行行長",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那您何時有空？明天下午？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“橋夾”克里夫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可以，我的秘書會安排會面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銀行行長",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "克里夫先生，我想多問一句，還請您不要介意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“橋夾”克里夫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "請說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銀行行長",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不知昨晚參與動亂的鎮民，您……會如何處理？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“橋夾”克里夫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "現場抓捕的暫時扣留在本艦，剩下的，我們還在追查中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銀行行長",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘖……那些混混之前就夠讓我們頭痛了，自身資產情況糟糕，如今便想著劫掠別人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“橋夾”克里夫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "聽起來，你對他們很熟悉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銀行行長",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是啊，都是銀行負債名單上的老熟人了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“橋夾”克里夫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "請問那份名單我們能看嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銀行行長",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "當然，要查的話，理應先從那些傢伙查起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海倫娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "謝謝你昨晚把那傢伙送過來，潔西卡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "里昂先生還好嗎？本尼離開了，連唯一保住的房子也在火災裡燒毀了，他……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海倫娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他沒說什麼……替他處理過傷口後，他就睡著了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "多虧他每天不回家，在大街上喝得醉醺醺的，所以才逃過這一劫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海倫娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "夠了，閉嘴，伍迪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海倫娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "算了，我上去看看里昂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "潔西卡……你昨天不是在地塊外迎接本艦嗎？為什麼突然回來了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "伍德洛先生，其實當時……我有事想找您，看到里昂先生家上方有煙升起，就先去了那裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "為了什麼找我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "其實……來地塊之後，我就一直在為本艦的到來提心弔膽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那是你們公司，來了不是好事嗎？那些你和隊友們一直覺得棘手的問題，現在有一整個基地來接手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可……對地塊上的大家來說，黑鋼的到來並不是什麼好事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "移動平台造價不菲，是極為稀缺的資源，政府不會放任它們廢棄，很大機率會翻修地塊，將其整合升級為更大的聚居點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "聽著仍然是好事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可生活在上面的居民，政府卻並不希望他們留在地塊上，所以想盡辦法讓他們主動離開……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以銀行來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "透過大量的貸款合約與對賭協議，銀行收回了不少沒落平台的資產，也將大批人送去了拓荒地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這樣的手段合法合理……挑不出一點問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真會有人願意乖乖吃虧嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "究竟有沒有人被迫吃虧……您在達維鎮待的時間更長，您比我更清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呵，這裡還是有幾塊硬骨頭不好啃的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以……像黑鋼這樣的傭兵公司來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銀行行長",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "徹查清楚後呢？克里夫先生，您難道打算將他們一直關押在巴倫基地嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“橋夾”克里夫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "試問在此之前你們是怎麼做的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銀行行長",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "地塊上還有警員的時候，那些傢伙會被送上去往拓荒地的車隊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“橋夾”克里夫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那我們依例行事就是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銀行行長",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那辛苦諸位了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“橋夾”克里夫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小事而已，期待明天的會面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銀行行長",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "克里夫先生，稍等，我這裡還有個小小的請求希望您能答應。黑鋼能否增派一些在銀行的保安力量？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“橋夾”克里夫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒問題……我會讓手下做進一步的安排。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銀行行長",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那明天下午見了，克里夫先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼情報小組成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“橋夾”克里夫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你怎麼看，蒂拉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼情報小組成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們又有髒活要幹了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“橋夾”克里夫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有什麼辦法，大家都是體面乾淨的人，招人恨的髒活做不了，只能傭兵來做壞人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼情報小組成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那銀行最後提出的請求我們如何應對？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“橋夾”克里夫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "昨夜他們有受到損失嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼情報小組成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他們受到的唯一損失是外牆上被人塗滿了污言穢語和塗鴉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“橋夾”克里夫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "算了……精神損失也是損失，隨便派些熟悉情況的人去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“橋夾”克里夫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "當下最要緊的事情，是如何在地塊啟動前，將無關人等清出去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以……你們的本艦來這裡不僅僅是為了拖拽地塊，對嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "幫助銀行驅逐負債居民，回收不良資產，都是傭兵公司要做的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "至於他們採取的方式，我想……應該不會是什麼懷柔手段。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……潔西卡，你希望我去做什麼呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "來到這裡前，有人讓我給您帶一顆子彈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "子彈？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……那人是誰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我的老闆，“橋夾”克里夫先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那又是誰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "伍德洛先生，那天去找你時，你的抽屜打開著，我從裡面看到了一張照片……克里夫先生就是那個搭著你肩膀的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……他換了名字啊……原來你的老闆……是他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "很抱歉，我是無意中瞥見的……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果你們過去認識的話，或許您能和他講幾句……我不知道……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您的話總該比別人有用才對吧……我真的沒有其他辦法了，真的……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "潔西卡，我很感激你對里昂，對海倫娜，或許還有對其他人的幫助。但我真的不明白，你堅持這麼做的原因是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你只是個傭兵，這不是你的義務……有些事就算看到了，也不代表你就要插手其中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "以前在維多利亞，我也……坐視事情就那麼發生。後果很糟糕……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那都是我的錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "謝謝你帶來了這顆子彈，我確實找了它很久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "先回去找你的朋友們吧，有些事我只能盡力而為。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海倫娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "伍迪——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海倫娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "伍迪，床上是空的，里昂出去了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我早上碰到他了，他去找邁爾斯了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海倫娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那你剛剛為什麼不說？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就當……我忘記了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你這傢伙再說一遍？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼傭兵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "先生，很抱歉，這裡已經被封鎖，不得隨便出入。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什麼叫不能出入？我在這裡待了半輩子！給我讓開！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼傭兵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抱歉，先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎，等等，你們架著我幹什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼傭兵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "先生，任務在身，還請見諒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們給我回來——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "里昂？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "邁爾斯？我剛還想進去找你來著！昨晚出了那麼大的亂子，你沒事吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我好著呢，倒是你，怎麼頭上多了這麼大的傷口？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "昨天路上遇到那群鬧事的人了，稍微……過了幾招。你怎麼不在塔裡面？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "騷亂平息後，這群人闖進來，說維護工作由黑鋼接手，然後就把我“禮送”出來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他們對你動手了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（瞄了一眼站崗的傭兵）沒……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們先走吧，這地方不適合說話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "里昂，你把門留著吧，我們等一下還要回動力爐去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那裡不是被人看著，誰也進不去嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我知道一條路能上到塔裡去，荒廢好多年了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那趕緊走啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "急什麼，先得找些開路工具，還有些東西我也得拿上……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要我幫你拿嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不用了，我都拿好了，走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咳咳，咳！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "灰這麼大，這到底是多早以前的路啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "少說有三十年沒來過人了……咳、咳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "誰啊？都把我叫過來了，還需要派人來——\n嗯，邁爾斯和里昂？你們來做什麼？他們怎麼會放你們進來的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "噓，小點聲，羅拉。我們就是想來看看，不會待很久的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "行……巡邏的人過來我立刻提醒你們，別拖太久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……幸虧遇上的不是別人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你這是幹嘛？動力爐已經有燃料了，你還要往裡面扔東西燒？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "里昂，你還記得嗎？今年七月就有好多人堅持不住簽了去拓荒地的協議。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……怎麼可能不記得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "現在銀行又開始拿那些手段折騰人了，比之前還熱鬧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我問過幾家人，有的已經在等去拓荒地的車隊了，有的還想再堅持堅持……可堅持下去也不會有結果阿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "邁爾斯，想說什麼就直說吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……里昂，我也打算走了。達維鎮的礦廠早就沒人要了，就算把地塊修好，也不會有人管我們這些礦工，到時沒活幹一樣要滾蛋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以……和我一起走吧，里昂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也許你說得沒錯，但我無論如何都不會走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……也對，這才像你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你來這裡就是為了和我說這個嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，我來這裡是想著，走之前……該燒的東西就燒了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等下，這本相簿裡有那麼多人的合照，你也打算燒了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "里昂，我不像你，我沒想在這過一輩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我還以為那是醉話……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我年輕時想過離開達維鎮，但弟妹太多，父母養家太難。所以十五歲那年，就糊里糊塗地進了礦廠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在鍋爐房裡被熱汗糊眼睛，被老工人指使，我心裡全是怨氣，但想想家人，也就咬牙堅持下去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "再後來，除了管這爐子，我也不知道自己能做什麼，只好繼續這樣過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你之前從不和我說這些……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "里昂，本尼說要走時，我雖然痛心，卻覺得他做得對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你不是那時才這樣覺得的，對嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是啊，趁他還沒被地塊牢牢捆住，就讓他走吧。考個大學，去鑄鐵城，去特里蒙，哪裡都好，就是別留在這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這麼說，我是該慶幸他走得是時候？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "里昂，這裡的土地都已經被徹底榨乾了。而那些政府裡的傢伙，要麼直接撂荒，要麼從別的地方挖來新土……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而我們在他們眼裡，只是不肯爛在土裡的草稈子，除了麻煩，什麼都不是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……等下，那是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這裡面怎麼還有張你們家的合照——"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "里昂反射性地想把手伸進爐膛，可在他的手接觸到高溫之前，那張相片已經變成了一股青煙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "應該是本尼落下的，我收拾的時候沒仔細瞧……抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒事，是我不對，居然還想著伸手撿出來。缺醫少藥的，這幾個水泡，也不知道什麼時候能長好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "爐膛中的火焰燒得正旺，幾縷火花從爐中濺射出來，被空氣冷卻，化作幾顆灰點，落在男人的鞋面上。\n嘆口氣，男人蹭了蹭眼角，才發現方才眼角的濕意已經被高溫烤乾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的地塊居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "先生，您一定誤會了，昨夜我一直留在家裡面，就沒上過街！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼傭兵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "女士，請配合。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的地塊居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "先生，您和您的上級說說情吧！再通融些時日吧！我帶著孩子呢，怎麼能冬天啟程去拓荒地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼傭兵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看來您也明白我們要帶您去哪裡了，我們也不想動粗，配合些吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的地塊居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喂！你們這是在做什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼傭兵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你是哪個小隊的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "潔西卡，裝備與應用技術部門，暫調至B.P.R.S.雷蛇小隊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼傭兵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦，原來您就是那位大小姐，久仰大名。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼傭兵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們奉命追查昨夜動亂的源頭，這些負債嚴重的居民是首要嫌疑對象，所以先從他們查起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這名單裡包括一個帶著孩子的單身母親嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼傭兵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "奉命行事罷了。何況，就算這位女士什麼都沒做，我們也得強制回收抵押房產。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "強制回收抵押房產……原來這就是克里夫先生提點我的原因嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼傭兵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大小姐，我不知道你嘀咕老闆名字做什麼，我只知道你妨礙我工作了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你知道自己在做的事和你們抓捕的那些混混做的，其實沒有任何區別嗎？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼傭兵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "奉命，奉命，大小姐，別再讓我重複這兩個字了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼傭兵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "報告，找到那女孩了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的地塊居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "先生……求您了，求您了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "放開那位女士！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼傭兵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我、我說，放開她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼傭兵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大小姐，和您不一樣，我們是要靠工資吃飯的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "工資……工資！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你的工資——不，不！我是說，我問你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我……我可以給你錢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼傭兵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您這是演哪一齣？賄賂？雷神工業的大小姐居然來賄賂我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "身為大小姐，做些拿錢砸人的蠢事，不也很正常嗎？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼傭兵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大小姐，您家裡有人罩著，可以不要職業操守，但我的職業操守是實實在在能從黑鋼手裡換錢的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼傭兵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您承認自己是大小姐也好，不承認也罷，總之別再為難我們這些底層的大頭兵了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼傭兵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果您真的那麼有錢，直接去銀行幫所有人把錢還掉不好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼傭兵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好了，大小姐，把手從銃套上拿開吧，我知道你昏了頭，但做事還是要有分寸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什、什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "低下頭，潔西卡發現，不知何時，自己的手已經按在了銃套上。\n看著眼前半是戒備半是輕蔑的傭兵，她最終嚥下了那句道歉，轉身朝銀行跑去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
